Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The ship sustained only minimal damage in the last fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't affect our return. There were seventeen dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-four wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.49,0:01:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Operations Officer Mori was also shot, and is in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Any chance she'll recover?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.12,0:02:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,a miracle would have to occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Miracles don't just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to make them happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a channel open to Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Todo, at Yamato Plan HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Yamato. We have received the Cosmo Reverse System from Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're now returning to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Then Iscandar was real!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it... You really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We've waited this past year, gritting our teeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,resting all our hopes on the Yamato's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:03:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Captain? Where is Okita?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His Planet Bomb Syndrome has returned, and he isn't in good shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well... Sanada, is Yuki all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Operations Officer Mori was wounded in combat. She's presently...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.81,0:03:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's wrong, Yamato? Do you read me? Yamato!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The hyperspace relays are still unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still working on them. Give me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Just because we're near the\NSolar System, don't lower your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But now we know our families back on Earth are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that rumor about the ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it's wearing a Defense Force uniform now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:04:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What I saw turned out to be Yurisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad... I heard it's a guy this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.59,0:04:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's more, it isn't a uniform from this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, from another ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would a ghost from another ship be on the Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.64,0:04:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Operations Officer Mori...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The XO suggested putting her in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can return to Earth, and get her to a real hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, even then, the probability of survival is under 0.1%...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's still possible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think her body will last that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:05:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a way we can at least stabilize things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We can use the capsule that kept\NYurisha alive while she was in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.67,0:05:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.97,0:05:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? You were having a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was dreaming... About Mamoru Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, he was with us on the Kirishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the captain, and I ran the engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was a new Weapons Officer, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking about the Second Battle of Mars?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The one battle we won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That success allowed us to push back the Garmillas invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But much was lost there, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.03,0:06:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokugawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think this is a good ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The flames of my life will not endure much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.29,0:06:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But this ship will live on. I want to pass this soul to the younger generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why so gloomy all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't die yet. Not until I've seen Earth with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.17,0:06:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get going, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:07:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamazaki is talented, but I still haven't taught him all we must impart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, wasn't Mamoru Kodai meant to be on the Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,His younger brother is doing his job just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.41,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanbu. Nanbu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Aihara?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That last communication with Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a hard truth to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's dead... And my aging mother is alone at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that Earth's a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, my mother won't last much longer, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that Earth is nearly dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But crying won't save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato will make it! We'll make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ensure it does!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's kind of acting like the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me! I've got the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.65,0:08:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get us to Earth ahead of schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's got the helm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for shift change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the XO?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.13,0:08:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He went to the Wave Motion Gun Control Room, to adjust the Cosmo Reverser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Invitation to Kato and Harada's Wedding Party
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It finally happened, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy persuading Kato. He's so old fashioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's nice to have something cheery going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't look good on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I mean... Us being the only ones that have something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's forcing himself to act cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But in reality, he's falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We must share our happiness with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Makoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure our child says the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So decide which one is best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Traditional Japanese kimonos, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,New life is born as the old passes away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, since we left Iscandar,\Nyou've been coming here frequently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose this place calms me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... Then stay here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki, Kato and I are getting married soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, get this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai says, "Have a party! You have to!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he told Kato. And Kato\Nwas mortified, but ended up agreeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys are so cute, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally... Just wait! I'll get the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor! Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where? To automatic navigation!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an interlocking recursive structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:11:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a brain's neural network.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.71,0:11:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cosmo Reverse System is like a living creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this wave motion pattern is the memory required to rebuild Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is to whom that memory belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think it's the memories of the Yamato's crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't think of anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But is that really it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is the Wave Motion Control Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't yell at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the XO is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to Officer Mori, Doctor Sade?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Before she died, she miraculously opened her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing she said was your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she wanted to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.35,0:12:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you again, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,XO Sanada, I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, we're almost home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want them to hear any more sad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's our turn now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And to you, Harada.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, do you remember when we were assigned to the Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I said this to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.15,0:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That if your orders caused one of my men to die needlessly, I'd never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done better than I could have hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.99,0:14:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I guarantee that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So Mori will be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kato...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamoru Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The system core is Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.37,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After following the chain of logic, that is my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.53,0:15:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard the rumors about a ghost on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You might laugh at me for being unscientific,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but I saw it as well. It was Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"Any sufficiently advanced technology is\Nindistinguishable from magic," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,After he died on Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,his memories were probably saved in some form.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost close enough to see Earth up close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all go see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And his consciousness is the core to activate the Cosmo Reverse System.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, Mamoru Kodai himself is the Cosmo Reverse System.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he is the Yamato itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the first time we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I was so angry about my brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't the best way to meet someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.23,0:16:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we both came aboard the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Our different ways of thinking meant we fought all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you told me how you'd lost your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:16:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And about how you kept trying to stay positive...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Without even knowing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I found myself drawn to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were kidnapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and when we met again...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized how I really felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you more than anyone in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there even any point
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.22,0:17:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,in a world without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.19,0:17:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.71,0:17:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Susumu, this is all I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.85,0:17:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I return your ship to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Okita.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:18:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The system is starting up on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Output is dropping fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.18,0:18:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep things steady! Don't shut down the Cosmo Reverser.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good! It won't accept our commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.18,0:18:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you start it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.23,0:18:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.61,0:19:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was shot, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a dream. You were having a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspect every part of the Cosmo Reverser! Prepare to reboot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The activation pulse that was his mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:19:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost entirely lost in the quantum sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It cannot be reactivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, even if the Yamato returns...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.68,0:20:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to save Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai... No, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.64,0:20:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your will? Is this what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth! We can see Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Sado...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you leave me alone for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Sado...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.93,0:21:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.76,0:21:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything brings back so many memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cosmo Reverse System has reactivated. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.15,0:22:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle has occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.27,0:22:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.14,0:22:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Kaoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.41,0:22:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess stuff like this does happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.24,0:22:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.50,0:22:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We all welcome Officer Mori's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.12,0:23:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.26,0:28:39.57,ED - Black,,0,0,0,,{\xbord85\ybord44\be12}NNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.26,0:26:15.01,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}This star is the only one
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.01,0:26:21.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}If you look for something so beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:26:21.48,0:26:27.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It is not something you can see
Dialogue: 1,0:26:27.27,0:26:29.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You will find it inside anyone
Dialogue: 1,0:26:29.73,0:26:33.11,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Love is the answer
Dialogue: 1,0:26:33.11,0:26:39.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sorrow and strife
Dialogue: 1,0:26:39.66,0:26:45.21,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}May cloud the blue sky
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.21,0:26:51.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The overlapping warmth
Dialogue: 1,0:26:51.84,0:26:57.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Becomes a light to illuminate the world
Dialogue: 1,0:26:57.72,0:27:03.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 1,0:27:03.73,0:27:07.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 1,0:27:07.36,0:27:10.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 1,0:27:10.32,0:27:12.15,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 1,0:27:12.15,0:27:15.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}But a dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 1,0:27:15.99,0:27:19.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.66,0:27:22.75,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 1,0:27:22.75,0:27:28.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If you have nothing special
Dialogue: 1,0:27:28.84,0:27:35.01,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Only the strength to yearn for it
Dialogue: 1,0:27:35.01,0:27:41.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bound to the limits of time
Dialogue: 1,0:27:41.18,0:27:52.61,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Create the trace of a miracle
Dialogue: 1,0:28:02.29,0:28:08.25,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 1,0:28:08.25,0:28:11.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 1,0:28:11.96,0:28:14.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 1,0:28:14.92,0:28:16.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 1,0:28:16.88,0:28:20.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 1,0:28:20.64,0:28:24.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 1,0:28:24.27,0:28:26.81,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 1,0:28:26.81,0:28:30.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 1,0:28:30.44,0:28:33.02,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Together with you
Dialogue: 1,0:28:33.02,0:28:39.57,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}Forever
